    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so basically it's more about bureaucracy and keeping everyone happy than actually being effective for a single country. isn't it pretty much a given then that these orgs are just a tool for whoever has the most influence to push their own agenda while pretending it's about \"international law\"?",
