    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty cynical way to look at it, but it sounds like you're saying the whole concept of 'global governance' is kind of a myth used to mask raw power politics. if that's the case, isn't it basically just a waste of time for smaller countries to even bother participating in these frameworks if they're just gonna get steamrolled anyway?",
